#: ../../source/docs/testing-with-replay.rst:5
#: 8b028519ceaf47c6b831709351632364
msgid "Testing with Replay"
msgstr "使用 Replay 进行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/testing-with-replay.rst:8
#: 06db459868734b4091fe05413090aa9d
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "简介"

#: ../../source/docs/testing-with-replay.rst:10
#: c02f4809936f45cab363203ef28c2a2a
msgid ""
"Replay is a program that takes a dataflash log file and replays it through "
"any branch's code allowing for state estimation issues to be analyzed using "
"that branch's code instead of the code used while generating the dataflash "
"log."
msgstr ""
"Replay 是一个程序，可以将 DataFlash 日志文件通过任意分支的代码回放，从而使用该分支的代码（而非生成日志时使用的代码）分析状态估计问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/testing-with-replay.rst:14
#: 12e2a8750490427b881b9a83cc07b1c7
msgid ""
"The log structure of the firmware used to create the log and the branch to "
"be tested with it must be the same."
msgstr "用于创建日志的固件与用于测试的分支的日志结构必须相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/testing-with-replay.rst:16
#: 978eda4b8a2b4d6ea010e83b65ba8772
msgid ""
"In order to use Replay the log must be generated with `LOG_REPLAY` set to 1."
" And it is preferred to also have `LOG_DISARMED` also set to 1, to obtain "
"the most information in the log."
msgstr ""
"要使用 Replay，日志必须在 `LOG_REPLAY` 设置为 1 时生成。同时建议也将 `LOG_DISARMED` 设置为 "
"1，以在日志中获取尽可能多的信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/testing-with-replay.rst:22
#: c25301837d5f4b50a852cea6088d89a8
msgid "Building Replay"
msgstr "构建 Replay"

#: ../../source/docs/testing-with-replay.rst:24
#: d3ba7d7eef8742a6b303bb8cdc47d46c
msgid ""
"On your Linux or Ubuntu machine, from the root directory of an ArduPilot "
"repository, using the branch you wish to replay the log through:"
msgstr "在您的 Linux 或 Ubuntu 机器上，从 ArduPilot 仓库根目录，使用您希望用于回放日志的分支运行："

#: ../../source/docs/testing-with-replay.rst:31
#: 6c9bf99d0dba48629dc771384c1e1d0c
msgid "This will create a file called ``build/sitl/tool/Replay``."
msgstr "这将生成一个名为 ``build/sitl/tool/Replay`` 的文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/testing-with-replay.rst:34
#: 80528b2cbf494c67a36920f246e57abb
msgid "Using Replay"
msgstr "使用 Replay"

#: ../../source/docs/testing-with-replay.rst:36
#: dde86b3d493e4ee6bf8f71510497e78f
msgid "Display the Replay help instructions:"
msgstr "显示 Replay 帮助说明："

#: ../../source/docs/testing-with-replay.rst:42
#: 9ccda09af5534c249be1ed629fe5a867
msgid "Run a log through Replay to generate the plot and EKF data files:"
msgstr "通过 Replay 运行日志以生成图表和 EKF 数据文件："

#: ../../source/docs/testing-with-replay.rst:48
#: bb20377821864473aa86b02fe520a45a
msgid ""
"This will produce an output file xxx.BIN in the folder \"./logs\", which "
"will be the highest numbered log since it was just created."
msgstr "这将在「./logs」目录中生成一个 xxx.BIN 输出文件，由于刚刚创建，编号最大。"

#: ../../source/docs/testing-with-replay.rst:50
#: 0d665fb589514f75b7139f553619361c
msgid ""
"Use MAVExplorer to graph the data. Both the original and Replay generated "
"EKF messages will be included in the log data. For example, instead of "
"possible graphs for IMU0 and IMU1's EKF2- NKF2 message items:  \"NKF2, "
"NKF2[0], and NKF2[1]\", there will also be \"NKF2[100] and NKF2][101]\" "
"graph groups for the replay generated log messages."
msgstr ""
"使用 MAVExplorer 绘制数据图表。日志数据中将同时包含原始和 Replay 生成的 EKF 消息。例如，原本可能有 IMU0 和 IMU1 的"
" EKF2-NKF2 消息图表组「NKF2、NKF2[0] 和 NKF2[1]」，现在还会有「NKF2[100] 和 NKF2][101]」图表组用于 "
"Replay 生成的日志消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/testing-with-replay.rst:52
#: 3a92ec57931142b0ace697e650d6be5f
msgid ""
"if using WSL, do not reference the log file via the external Windows WSL "
"path since this will be extremely slow. Instead copy the log from the "
"Windows file system directly into the WSL environment and execute Replay on "
"it within that environment."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 WSL，请勿通过外部 Windows WSL 路径引用日志文件，因为速度会极慢。请将日志从 Windows 文件系统直接复制到 WSL "
"环境，并在 WSL 环境中对其执行 Replay。"

