msgid "Changing parameters"
msgstr "修改参数"

#: ../../source/docs/testing-with-replay.rst:57
#: 9dcefc94f65149b39b94ba50be6a2850
msgid ""
"Simulation parameters may be changed before replaying a log using the "
"option: ``-parm NAME=VALUE`` (this sets the parameter ``NAME`` to "
"``VALUE``). The parameters which may be edited are those listed by running "
"the \"param show <param-name>\" command in SITL."
msgstr ""
"在回放日志之前，可以使用选项 ``-parm NAME=VALUE``（将参数 ``NAME`` 设置为 "
"``VALUE``）更改仿真参数。可编辑的参数为在 SITL 中运行「param show <param-name>」命令所列出的那些参数。"

